/Title (Maureen Hladky DIRECTOR OF OPERATIONAL DUE DILIGENCE With extensive experience in operational due diligence, Maureen Hladky is the Head of Operational Due Diligence, overseeing operational reviews of client-invested and approved managers. She previously led operational due diligence at Analytical Research and held investment due diligence roles at Pioneer Alternative Investments. She holds a B.S. in Management and Communications from Adelphi University)
